<title>PHILIPPINES: Union Bank 1996 net at 961.8 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Union Bank 1996 net at 961.8 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of the Philippines said on Monday its unaudited net income in 1996 reached 961.8 million pesos, 32 percent higher than 729 million pesos in 1995.  </p>
<p>The bank said profits were mainly driven by loans which surged 55 percent to 27.6 billion pesos at the end of 1996.</p>
<p>The bank said it will release more details of its earnings later.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
